{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人劉愷威與黎紀君認愛後愈愛愈高調，本月（11月）23日33歲生日的黎紀君早前開生日P，劉愷威以「男主人」身份出席，兩人瘋狂放閃大晒恩愛。</p><p>除了與一大班朋友慶祝外，兩人當然都要過「二人世界」，日前就齊齊到法國餐廳撐枱腳食燭光晚餐，原來該餐廳屬</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:43:58.769837+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:09:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:37:16.337509+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:37:16.337509+00:00","content_hash":"c49fd36d5cecdc3a0c177bc32b78f198d18493d881d1f5bfab77546027aaa853","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}